  - key: E:Pests
    title: Pragas
    art: {fileID: 0}
    text: "As pragas destru\xEDram parte das planta\xE7\xF5es\n\nA cultura afetada
      regride no crescimento, inclusive as plantas prontas.\n\nDura\xE7\xE3o: 2 dias"
